{"id":"n71579-1-8","stage":1,"title":"짜증 · 心烦","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71579-1-8-1","ko":"걔는 왜 이렇게 사람을 짜증 나게 하는지 모르겠어.","zh":"真搞不懂，他为什么总这么让人生气。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"걔는","meaning":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"걔：“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"걔","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64369","senseId":"1","lemma":"걔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람을","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짜증","meaning":"心烦，厌烦，闹心","explanation":"짜증：心烦，厌烦，闹心","readings":[{"term":"짜증","audio":"/audio/78dd3ebff92b1941ec4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71579","senseId":"1","lemma":"짜증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나게","meaning":"感到烦躁（짜증이/가 나다）","explanation":"나다：感到烦躁（짜증이/가 나다）；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"12","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는지","meaning":"承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。","explanation":"하다：承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"23","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6488cd1503b8fc1c","term":"걔","zh":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/6488cd1503b8fc1cb5fa.mp3","entryId":"64369","definition":"“그 아이(那个孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"78dd3ebff92b1941","term":"짜증","zh":"心烦，厌烦，闹心","audio":"/audio/78dd3ebff92b1941ec4a.mp3","entryId":"71579","definition":"由于不满意而发火或把厌恶之情表露于外；或指那样的性格。","pronunciation":["짜증"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"感到烦躁（짜증이/가 나다）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"感到烦躁（짜증이/가 나다）","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/19b504ba229b9d3a2aba.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71579-1-8-2","ko":"무슨 화나는 일이라도 있어?","zh":"是发生了什么让人生气的事吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화나는","meaning":"生气，发火","explanation":"화나다：生气，发火；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"화나다","audio":"/audio/380dff375fc26c29cffe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87582","senseId":"1","lemma":"화나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이라도","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"有，起","explanation":"있다：有，起；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"15","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"380dff375fc26c29","term":"화나다","zh":"生气，发火","audio":"/audio/380dff375fc26c29cffe.mp3","entryId":"87582","definition":"非常懊恼或不合心意而心情变差。","pronunciation":["화ː나다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有，起","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"在某人身上发生某件事情。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/9a19e789867caeff3d57.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71579","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":47,"sequenceScore":2.0935,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["真搞不懂，他为什么总这么让人生气。","是发生了什么让人生气的事吗？","长辈知道你的这个问题吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["真搞不懂，他为什么总这么让人生气。","是发生了什么让人生气的事吗？","长辈知道你的这个问题吗？"],"answer":1}]}
